		(descr "Kailh PG1316S ultra-low-profile switch. Terminals 1/2 are PLATED THROUGH-HOLES so the switch can be soldered from the underside of the board. Mounting pads duplicated F.Cu/B.Cu for a reversible PCB. Terminal positions taken from the CPG1316S01D02 datasheet (2 x 1.55 mm pads at +/-2.5, 2.65).")
